@startuml Sequence Diagram - Gestionare Caz Urgență

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam maxMessageSize 50
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 5

title Diagramă Secvență - Gestionare Caz Urgență

actor "Medic" as Doctor
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "API" as API
participant "Helpers" as Helpers
database "Database" as DB

== Creare Caz ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează formular\n(patientId, triageLevel, chiefComplaint)
Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency
API -> Helpers: createEmergencyCase()
Helpers -> DB: INSERT emergency_cases\n(state: 'arrival')
DB --> Helpers: caseId
Helpers --> API: EmergencyCase
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

== Workflow Tranziții Stare ==
loop Pentru fiecare etapă
    Doctor -> Frontend: Completează formular etapă
    Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[id]/[etapă]
    API -> Helpers: updateState(caseId, newState)
    Helpers -> DB: UPDATE currentState\n+ INSERT transition
    DB --> Helpers: Success
    Helpers --> API: Updated case
    API --> Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend -> Frontend: Actualizează Kanban
end

note right of Helpers
  Tranziții valide:
  arrival → triage
  triage → consent
  consent → admission
  admission → treatment
  treatment → discharge
end note

@enduml
